WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.307
Open Parlay and add the first leg. The page loads before the control becomes available.

2
00:00:02.307 --> 00:00:06.138
Open the first leg’s Window picker and choose AAPL 15m. Keep its Up side.

3
00:00:06.138 --> 00:00:08.000
Add another market to the Parlay preview.

4
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.700
Open the second leg’s Window picker and choose MSFT 15m.

5
00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:14.400
Set the MSFT leg to Down while leaving AAPL Up. Both legs must land for the ticket to pay.

6
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:28.100
Enter a stake of one test credit and review the quote, including the displayed maximum payout and correlation adjustment.

7
00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:31.953
Review the current quote and each leg. The displayed multiplier is about 2.9 times, and the exact payout updates with pricing. Hover Place without clicking it; this walkthrough submits no ticket.
